# Expert avatars: 279 SVGs owned by the project but kept off the repository by
# request, so they live only on the machine that has them. Both entries matter —
# the sources and the module generated from them. Without the sources a build
# still works: `pnpm avatars:inline` writes an empty map and every card falls
# back to its frontmatter emoji.
assets/avatar/
src/client/avatars.ts
